      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S PEAKIN' (1) impressed when posting a slick 34.26 over 595m at Angle Park three back then has hit the frame in both runs since. Can return to winning form here if runs up to best figures. MARLI MOO (3) goes very well at this course having never missed the frame including two wins. Recorded a 0.8 lengths win (43.84) in a Grade 5/6 last time at Angle Park. Looks well placed here and among the chances. WEBLEC POLLY (7) was strongly fancied last time on the back of a win two back but could only manage fourth (44.17) at Angle Park. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Expected to feature in the finish. PAW OLLIE (5) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
